  m_text: "A group of weary travelers stumbles upon the forgotten ruins of an ancient
    temple of Zeus, standing silent beneath time\u2019s weight. The land around it
    lies fractured and lifeless, as if waiting for someone to restore its lost harmony.\r\n\r\nNow
    that task falls to you\u2014rebuild what was broken, connect what was divided,
    and breathe life back into the world, one careful placement at a time.\r\n"
